@startuml
title Flujo GET - documentos

skinparam shadowing false

actor Cliente
participant "FastAPI" as FastAPI
participant "Document Router" as Router
participant "DocumentService" as Service
participant "DocumentRepository\ncontract" as Contract
participant "MongoDocumentRepository" as Repository
database "MongoDB" as MongoDB

== GET /api/documents/{doc_id} ==

Cliente -> FastAPI : GET /api/documents/{doc_id}
FastAPI -> Router : validar y convertir doc_id a UUID
Router -> Service : get_document(doc_id)
Service -> Contract : get_by_id(doc_id)
Contract -> Repository : get_by_id(doc_id)
Repository -> MongoDB : find_one({"_id": str(doc_id)})
MongoDB --> Repository : document | null

alt documento encontrado
  Repository -> Repository : _map_to_record(document)
  Repository --> Service : DocumentRecord
  Service --> Router : DocumentRecord
  Router --> Cliente : 200 DocumentResponse
else documento inexistente
  Repository --> Service : None
  Service --> Router : None
  Router --> Cliente : 404 Documento no encontrado
end

== GET /api/documents ==

Cliente -> FastAPI : GET /api/documents
FastAPI -> Router : route request
Router -> Service : list_documents()
Service -> Contract : get_all(limit=100)
Contract -> Repository : get_all(limit=100)
Repository -> MongoDB : find().limit(100)
MongoDB --> Repository : documents
Repository -> Repository : mapear cada document a DocumentRecord
Repository --> Service : list[DocumentRecord]
Service --> Router : list[DocumentRecord]
Router --> Cliente : 200 list[DocumentResponse]

@enduml
